# Half-wave rectifier with a smoothing capacitor and a load resistor.
# Exercises the diode (conduction direction matters), a multi-node top
# rail with junction dots, and parallel vertical branches.
circuit Half-wave rectifier

acsource  2  8  v  AC1  50Hz
wire 2 5  2 3  5 3
diode     8  3  h  D1  1N4007
wire 11 3  17 3
dot 14 3
capacitor 14  6  v  C1  470u
resistor  17  6  v  R1  2.2k
label 18 2.4 Vdc
wire 2 11  2 12  17 12
wire 14 9  14 12
dot 14 12
wire 17 9  17 12
gnd 8 12
dot 8 12
